","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7162,"playId":"401869933266","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7049,"playId":"401869933270","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7323,"playId":"401869933274","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7448,"playId":"401869933281","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7433,"playId":"401869933285","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.755,"playId":"401869933298","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7232,"playId":"401869933302","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.6993,"playId":"401869933306","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.6061,"playId":"401869933310","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.5662,"playId":"401869933315","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.5568,"playId":"401869933322","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.5589,"playId":"401869933325","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.4905,"playId":"401869933329","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.4383,"playId":"401869933336","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.437,"playId":"401869933340","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.4089,"playId":"401869933344","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.4356,"playId":"401869933348","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.4392,"playId":"401869933354","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3859,"playId":"401869933352","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3874,"playId":"401869933359","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3287,"playId":"401869933357","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.308,"playId":"401869933365","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.2051,"playId":"401869933417","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1827,"playId":"401869933439","tiePercentage":0}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"3625","guid":"df01c846-dbdd-3c2a-801a-4e30aff27f86","fullName":"Centennial Bank Stadium","address":{"city":"Jonesboro","state":"AR","zipCode":"72401","country":"USA"},"grass":false,"images":[{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/venues/college-football/day/interior/3625.jpg","width":2000,"height":1125,"alt":"","rel":["full","day","interior"]}]},"attendance":14237},"article":{"headline":"South Alabama beats Arkansas State 56-49 in the highest scoring FBS game this season","description":"— Keenan Phillips ran for 157 yards and three touchdowns, and he added a 100-yard kickoff return as South Alabama beat Arkansas State 56-49 on Thursday night for the most combined...","story":"JONESBORO, Ark. -- — <a href=\"https://x.com/SouthAlabamaFB/status/2108351939243131056\"><a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5295070/keenan-phillips\" target=\"_new\">Keenan Phillips</a> ran for 157 yards and three touchdowns, and he added a 100-yard kickoff return</a> as South Alabama beat Arkansas State 56-49 on Thursday night for the most combined points of any FBS game this season.\n\n\r\n              South Alabama (4-2, 2-0 Sun Belt Conference) matched its win total from a season ago when it finished 4-8.\n\n\r\n              South Alabama QB <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5148858/jared-hollins\" target=\"_new\">Jared Hollins</a> had two short rushing touchdowns in a span of 21 seconds to take a 34-21 lead with 1:30 remaining in the first half. Then, Arkansas State went 53 yards in four plays to score a touchdown for the highest combined points in a first half of any FBS game this season at 62.\n\n\r\n              Arkansas State QB <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5123665/trey-owens\" target=\"_new\">Trey Owens</a>, in his sixth career start, plowed ahead for a 1-yard touchdown run to get within seven points with just under seven minutes remaining in the game. But South Alabama chewed up the rest of the clock on a 13-play drive. \n\n\r\n              Hollins was 6-of-10 passing for 76 yards with a touchdown. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5124334/pj-martin\" target=\"_new\">PJ Martin</a> added 95 yards rushing and a touchdown as South Alabama used 50 carries to gain 296 yards. \n\n\r\n              Owens was 32 of 43 for 418 yards and four touchdowns for Arkansas State (2-4, 0-2). Owens also had a rushing touchdown, but he was intercepted two times. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5121601/hunter-summers\" target=\"_new\">Hunter Summers</a> caught nine passes for 145 yards and two touchdowns. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5156215/timothy-carter\" target=\"_new\">Timothy Carter</a> had two short touchdown runs.\n\n\r\n              The Jaguars snapped a two-game skid in the 15-game series. \n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              South Alabama: Plays at Marshall on Oct. 20.\n\n\r\n              Arkansas State: Plays at Southern Miss on Oct. 17.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Fnewsletters&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cdcd4c927a3014947713f08def3da887f%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C639216317087773713%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=592GG7Tx9gHi6vEFt3ytKh9NsJsnsJX5%2FPfFbPmAML8%3D&reserved=0\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>. Visit <a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Fhub%2Fap-top-25-college-football-poll&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cdcd4c927a3014947713f08def3da887f%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C639216317087791086%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=ia6nZ9tg%2FZcgm%2BFi8LWTUGjusXBzP7sDOqfdsmjeNig%3D&reserved=0\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Fhub%2Fcollege-football&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cdcd4c927a3014947713f08def3da887f%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C6392163170